    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "speaker": "passenger",
      "start": 219.77909375,
      "end": 221.50034375,
      "duration": 1.721,
      "text": " Porque la PDM dice otra cosa.",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "speaker": "passenger",
      "start": 222.05721875,
      "end": 224.11596875,
      "duration": 2.059,
      "text": " La PDM dice que no pasó nada.",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "speaker": "passenger",
      "start": 224.11875,
      "end": 228.21659375,
      "duration": 4.098,
      "text": " A ti pasó, entonces me da una documentación, me explique.",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "speaker": "passenger",
      "start": 252.36471875,
      "end": 266.7,
      "duration": 14.335,
      "text": "Entiende, si tú comprobó y tú miró la cámara, entonces tu palabra es la última. Entonces tú tienes que dar algo que explique, porque es la carta de desembarque que la PDI lo recibió.",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "speaker": "airline_security_official",
      "start": 266.7,
      "end": 269.037218752,
      "duration": 2.337,
      "text": " La carta de desembarque se la entrega a la dos líneas de la PDI.",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "speaker": "passenger",
      "start": 269.03721875,
      "end": 275.5,
      "duration": 6.463,
      "text": " Ya, ok, está bien. Pero ahí está explicando por qué me sacaron del vuelo. Yo quiero saber por qué me sacaron del vuelo.",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "speaker": "airline_security_official",
      "start": 275.5,
      "end": 277.1,
      "duration": 1.6,
      "text": " Porque ingresaste sin autorización al avion..",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "speaker": "passenger",
      "start": 277.1,
      "end": 280.1,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "text": "Yo te digo que eso es mentira, porque la PDI comprobó que es mentira.",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "speaker": "airline_security_official",
      "start": 280.1,
      "end": 281.8,
      "duration": 1.7,
      "text": " Yo te digo que eso lo había en cámara.\n\n",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "speaker": "passenger",
      "start": 281.8,
      "end": 293.4,
      "duration": 11.6,
      "text": " Entonces tú tienes que probar eso porque tú ver y me contar que eso ahora... Entonces tú ves la cámara, la PDI está mintiendo?\n No, pero explícame, la PDI está mintiendo?",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "speaker": "airline_security_official",
      "start": 293.4,
      "end": 294.4,
      "duration": 1.0,
      "text": " Yo voy a hablar con PDI ahora.",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "speaker": "passenger",
      "start": 294.1,
      "end": 296.0,
      "duration": 1.9,
      "text": "Por favor. Yo te espero aca.",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "speaker": "airline_security_official",
      "start": 296.0,
      "end": 299.0,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "text": " Pero nadie más le va a dar otra respuesta.",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "speaker": "passenger",
      "start": 298.5,
      "end": 311.21971875,
      "duration": 12.72,
      "text": " Ya, mira. No importa. Tu esta me diciendo que yo entré impropiamente en el vuelo, pero la PDI ya comprobó que no. Entonces, por favor, compruebe con la PDI.",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "speaker": "airline_security_official",
      "start": 307.0,
      "end": 309.29971875,
      "duration": 2.3,
      "text": "Ahora voy hablar con la PDI.",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "speaker": "passenger",
      "start": 308.0,
      "end": 309.0,
      "duration": 1.0,
      "text": "Yo te espero aca, muchas gracias",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
